sequenceDiagram

participant SA as Super Admin
participant MR as Metadata Registry
participant PC as Change Policy Catalog
participant ES as Event Bus
participant TS as Template Service
participant OC as Org Capability Profile
participant OA as Org Admin
participant PS as Package Service
participant RT as Runtime Services

SA->>MR: Create/Edit Metadata Draft

MR->>PC: Evaluate ChangePolicyRule
PC-->>MR: Impact Assessment

MR->>SA: Show Impact Summary
note over MR,SA: Impact Summary\nMetadata Version Impact\nTemplate Adoption Impact\nOrg Readiness Impact\nRuntime Impact

SA->>MR: Confirm Publish

MR->>MR: Create Metadata Version (if required)

MR->>ES: MetadataChangePublished

ES->>TS: Metadata Change Event
ES->>OC: Metadata Change Event

TS->>TS: Evaluate Metadata Bindings
TS->>TS: Generate ChangeSet/Diff

OC->>OC: Recalculate Readiness
OC->>OC: Update Capability Status

TS-->>OA: Upgrade Available

OA->>TS: Review Diff

alt Org Adopts Change
    TS->>TS: Create New Org Master Version
    TS->>TS: Preserve Org Overrides
else Org Ignores Change
    TS->>TS: Keep Existing Version
end

PS->>OC: Validate Capability

OC-->>PS: Available / Setup Pending / Blocked

PS->>TS: Request Eligible Care Plans

TS-->>PS: Published Org Care Plans Only

PS->>PS: Link Care Plan Version

RT->>PS: Read LinkedOrgCarePlanVersionID

PS-->>RT: Care Plan Version Snapshot

RT->>RT: Create Patient Runtime Snapshot

RT->>RT: Future metadata changes do not update existing runtime records